<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>API Cost Estimate</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compute cost estimates for GPT-3.5 and GPT-4o using OpenAI’s May 2025 pricing. Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.3 API Cost Estimate ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ TAG–EQA: Text–And–Graph for Event Question Answering via Structured Prompting Strategies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows that a full CoT evaluation with GPT-4o would exceed $950, so we restrict GPT results to the Small subset.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T7" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T7.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:54.2pt;vertical-align:-24.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(15.9pt,-2.5pt) scale(1.10179302464599,1.10179302464599) ;">
<table id="A1.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T7.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T7.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt Type</span></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T7.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Total Tokens</span></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T7.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cost (USD)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">GPT-3.5</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Zero-shot</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">9.7M in / 53k out</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">$4.95</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">GPT-3.5</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Few-shot</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">12.6M in / 53k out</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">$6.36</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">GPT-4o</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">CoT</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">21.1M in / 212M out</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">$957.16</td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Estimated cost to run GPT models on Full dataset.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Per-Model Prompting Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report accuracy for each model across all <math id="A1.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 3</annotation></semantics></math> prompting configurations. These tables complement Section <a href="#S5.SS4" title="5.4 Which prompting strategy works best for each model? ‣ 5 Results ‣ TAG–EQA: Text–And–Graph for Event Question Answering via Structured Prompting Strategies" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.4</span></a> and clarify which strategies and modalities are most effective for different architectures.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">T5.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Performs best with Few+Text, but degrades when structure or reasoning is added.
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:165.6pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
