<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">57.5</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">51.9</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">CoT</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">55.2</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">56.9</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.p1.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">50.4</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table ltx_align_center">
<span class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>T5 accuracy across all strategies and modalities.</span>
</span></span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">QwQ.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Excels with TAG+Few and TAG+CoT. Gains are consistent across most settings.
