<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">70.5</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">79.4</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">CoT</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">65.8</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">72.7</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.p1.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">74.8</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T9" class="ltx_table ltx_align_center">
<span class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>QwQ accuracy across all strategies and modalities.</span>
</span></span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">GPT.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Best performance under CoT (GPT-4o). GPT-3.5 shows smaller gains and flat modality sensitivity.
